 to search for Pandora as Kaitou Kid and destroy it, in order to prevent the organization from obtaining their goals.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.1}],"value":8.1,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":9987,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}